{"seq":3,"slug":"adoption","title":"平台采纳与推广","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/adoption","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-adoption-strategy","title":"平台采纳策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/adoption/platform-adoption-strategy","wordCount":1430,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"developer-self-service","title":"开发者自助服务设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/adoption/developer-self-service","wordCount":1324,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-maturity-model","title":"平台成熟度模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/adoption/platform-maturity-model","wordCount":1331,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 平台采纳与推广\n\n本章处理平台工程中最容易被低估的难题：如何让目标用户（开发者）真正使用你构建的平台。近 70% 的 IDP 项目未能在 18 个月内交付 ROI，主因并非技术不足，而是采纳失败。\n\n采纳策略、自助服务体验设计与成熟度模型三个主题分别回答：如何制定推广路线图、如何降低使用门槛、以及如何评估并驱动组织级演进。\n\n本章的核心原则是\"让正确的事成为容易的事\"——黄金路径覆盖 80% 的常见场景，开发者自然会选择平台提供的路径而非自行造轮子。\n"}